2
00:00:08,079 --> 00:00:12,440
Morning I don't set an alarm I just kind of wake up naturally.
早上我不设闹钟，就自然而然地醒来。

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:18,560
I have this skylight that comes in forces me to wake up by the sun which I love we have a great relationship.
天窗透进来的阳光会叫醒我，我很喜欢，和阳光相处得很好。

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:23,040
Something that I kind of love having as a start of my day are these essential oils.
我喜欢用这些精油作为一天的开始。

5
