Um this diffuser that I have next to me I have these like energetic oils that are supposed to like wake me up essentially.
旁边这个扩香器里的精油据说能让我精神起来，基本就是唤醒我。

6
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:37,599
So they're working cuz here I am I usually will like say some affirmations I'll start my day with things that I'm grateful for.
看来它们起作用了，我就在这里。我通常会说些积极的肯定话，用自己感激的事开启一天。

7
00:00:37,599 --> 00:00:46,360
I think it's really important to uh train our minds to try to focus on what we have instead of what we don't have.
我觉得训练自己关注已经拥有的东西，而不是没有的东西，真的很重要。

8
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:51,520
Life goes by so fast and we look back and we go oh I had so much and I didn't even realize it in the moment.
生活过得很快，回头看才会想：原来拥有那么多，当时竟没意识到。

9
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:59,879
So trying to be more mindful I think that's really important let's go make some tea actually let's do that first.
所以我觉得更用心地感受当下很重要。去泡茶吧，其实我们先做这个。

10
00:00:59,879 --> 00:01:07,320
I actually really really love prioritizing the time in my morning that I have to myself before I go out into a big scary world of new York city.
走进纽约这个热闹又令人有点畏惧的世界之前，我很重视早晨属于自己的时间。

11
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:13,230
I don't have a tea kettle uh so I use this pot I think I might have one I can't find it.
我没有烧水壶，所以用这个锅。也许有一个，但我找不到了。

12
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:20,760
Um my sister's not here and my sister's way better at making teas there's so many healthy benefits of drinking green tea this one is is decaffeinated.
我姐姐不在，她更擅长泡茶。她说绿茶有很多益处，这款是不含咖啡因的。

13
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:26,000
Which I don't know why I'm not drinking caffeinated tea right now I could probably use it.
我也不知道现在为什么不喝含咖啡因的茶，其实我可能挺需要提神。

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,479
But I think I'll have caffeine throughout the day so it's nice to kind of start with a fresh cup of green tea.
不过白天应该还会摄入咖啡因，所以先喝一杯新泡的绿茶也不错。

15
00:01:31,479 --> 00:01:35,439
Other thing I do while I'm waiting for this to heat up is I light sage.
等水热起来时，我还会点燃鼠尾草。

16
00:01:51,040 --> 00:02:02,710
We stop that I'm going to try to not burn my okay that wasn't as bad as I thought it was going to be I thought that was going to be really hot.
那个停一下，我尽量别烫到自己……还好，没有想象中那么糟，我以为会很烫。

17
00:02:07,039 --> 00:02:19,760
Okay I usually love to go out on my fire escape sometimes I just go out and people watch sometimes I'll play guitar out here sometimes I will read or journal.
我通常很喜欢到消防梯平台上，有时观察路人，有时弹吉他，有时阅读或写日记。

18
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:27,400
Um one of the reasons I wanted to live in new York is to have a fire escape cuz I'm a drama queen I guess.
我想住在纽约的一个原因就是想有消防梯平台，可能因为我有点戏多吧。

19
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:32,949
Um you know sometimes I sit here and I think about what I should have said in an argument or I listen to the sirens.
有时坐在这里，想着争论时本该说些什么，或者听着警笛。

20
00:02:32,959 --> 00:02:38,959
It's kind of just a great way to get outside before I start the day and all the craziness begins.
在一天和所有忙乱开始之前，这是一种很好的出门透气方式。

21
00:02:38,959 --> 00:02:43,360
The other night I actually came out here with my friend and I started playing harmonica.
前几天晚上我和朋友来到这里，我开始吹口琴。

22
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:49,800
I don't know how to play harmonica very well but I was just like I'll learn and then I'll see if anybody down here has any tips for me.
我口琴吹得不太好，不过想着先学，再看看下面的人有没有什么建议。

23
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:55,160
Um because the streets get really crowded at night so I started playing harmonica and then they were like play as billy joel.
因为夜里街上很拥挤，我就吹起口琴，下面的人喊起了 Billy Joel。

24
00:02:55,160 --> 00:03:02,519
And so I went inside and I learned how to play um well I I should say that roughly learned how to play piano man by billy joel.
我回屋学着吹 Billy Joel 的《Piano Man》，准确说只是大概学了个样子。

25
00:03:02,519 --> 00:03:07,720
And then my friend came outside with his guitar and we started um playing songs for people down on the street.
随后朋友带着吉他出来，我们开始给楼下街上的人演奏。

26
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:10,480
So this fire escape holds many memories for me.
所以这个消防梯平台承载着我的许多回忆。

27
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:17,200
I love watching dogs that's probably the best part about living in new York hands down or the dogs.
我喜欢看狗，纽约生活最棒的一点毫无疑问就是狗。

28
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:19,840
Um and trying to see if the dogs look like their owners.
还喜欢观察狗和它们的主人是不是长得像。

29
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:43,220
And again if I'm like feeling really moody then it's it's sort of like I'm starring in my own music video right now.
如果我情绪上来了，这感觉又像自己正在出演一支音乐录像。
